;; hayari 流行 — Wikidata P31 (instance of) QID -> content kind.
;;
;; PROVENANCE: every QID below was resolved against the live Wikidata API on
;; 2026-08-10 and the `;; label:` comment is the label the API actually
;; returned, not a label assumed from the QID. One guess was wrong when checked
;; (Q11086742 is "anime television program", not a season), which is why the
;; labels are pinned here rather than trusted from memory.
;;
;;   curl 'https://www.wikidata.org/w/api.php?action=wbgetentities&ids=Q11424&props=labels&languages=en&format=json'
;;
;; :rank breaks ties when a work carries several P31 values. Lower wins, and
;; more specific kinds rank lower, so an "anime film" is not flattened to
;; "film" merely because Wikidata lists both.
;;
;; This table is COVERAGE, not a filter. A P31 that is absent here yields
;; :unclassified and is counted in the coverage report — it is never guessed at
;; and never silently dropped. Add a row when a real observation needs one.

